{"id":"subotica","name":"苏博蒂察","en":"Subotica","country":"Serbia","lat":46.1002,"lng":19.6653,"dek":"多瑙平原上的新艺术小城","history":"苏博蒂察的名字第一次见于文字是在中世纪，当时写作Zabatka，是匈牙利王国边境一座不起眼的小镇。1241年前后蒙古大军横扫东欧，附近村庄被毁，幸存者涌入这里，聚落才渐渐成形。15世纪后期，匈牙利国王马加什把城镇交给亲戚登格莱吉·亚诺什，后者为防奥斯曼入侵，筑起一座城堡。\n\n1526年莫哈奇战役后，匈牙利王国崩溃，苏博蒂察落入奥斯曼之手，匈牙利居民大批北逃。巴奇卡一带的塞尔维亚雇佣兵首领约万·内纳德一度以苏博蒂察为中心建立自己的势力，甚至在此自称塞尔维亚沙皇，但不久遇刺身亡。奥斯曼统治持续到17世纪末，旧城几乎荡然无存。\n\n1697年欧根亲王在森塔击败奥斯曼军队后，哈布斯堡王朝在此设立军事边境。1743年城镇获得市民特许状，1779年玛丽亚·特蕾莎女皇将它升格为自由皇家城市，城市随之改名玛丽亚·特雷西奥波利斯。19世纪铁路通达、电厂建成，苏博蒂察迎来建设高峰，新艺术风格的建筑成批出现。一战结束后它划归新成立的南斯拉夫，从帝国腹地变成边境城市。","culture":"苏博蒂察坐落在巴奇卡平原上，匈牙利人、塞尔维亚人、布涅瓦茨人、犹太人曾长期混居，街道招牌上常并排写着几种文字。这种多语共存的气氛渗进日常，也渗进建筑：20世纪初的市政厅、犹太会堂和一批住宅楼，把新艺术运动的花卉曲线、红砖与彩瓷用得淋漓尽致。\n\n城市不大，却有一种中欧小城的从容。咖啡馆沿街铺开，人们坐在户外消磨下午；剧院的历史可追溯到19世纪中叶。城外的帕利奇湖畔是当地人散步、划船的地方，平原的风吹过芦苇，和城里的瓷砖屋顶属于同一种安静。","pull":"几种语言在同一条街上讲着各自的故事","sights":[{"name":"市政厅","orig":"Gradska kuća","intro":"苏博蒂察的心脏，建在新艺术运动高潮期，红砖墙体、彩瓷屋顶和花卉纹样让它更像一件放大的工艺品。塔楼可以登顶，俯瞰整片平原城市的天际线。广场四周的咖啡馆和长椅，是看这座建筑最舒服的位置。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Gradska_ku%C4%87a_Subotica_-_floralni_motiv_na_plafonu%2C_secesija.jpg/960px-Gradska_ku%C4%87a_Subotica_-_floralni_motiv_na_plafonu%2C_secesija.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":null},{"name":"犹太会堂","orig":"Sinagoga u Subotici","intro":"1902年落成的新艺术风格会堂，花瓣状的穹顶、彩绘玻璃和铁艺细节都保存得相当完整。它见证过当地犹太社群的盛期，也经历过20世纪的劫难。如今这里既是宗教场所，也用于音乐会和文化活动，进去抬头看穹顶值得花几分钟。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Wiki.Vojvodina_VII_Subotica_4599_03.jpg/960px-Wiki.Vojvodina_VII_Subotica_4599_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":null},{"name":"帕利奇湖","orig":"Palićko jezero","intro":"城郊的一片浅湖，岸边有林荫道、老式浴场和歇脚的长椅。夏天有人划船、骑车，秋天芦苇泛黄，水面很静。19世纪末这里曾是颇受欢迎的度假地，湖畔建筑带着那个年代的样子，适合慢慢走一圈。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Palic_lake_view.jpg/960px-Palic_lake_view.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":643},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%95%E5%88%A9%E5%A5%87%E6%B9%96"},{"name":"主教座堂","orig":"Katedrala svete Terezije Avilske","intro":"城市主广场旁的天主教堂，献给阿维拉的圣特蕾莎，18世纪后期建成，属于巴洛克风格。与周围的新艺术建筑相比，它显得朴素厚重。内部安静，彩绘和祭坛保存完好，正午阳光透过窗户落在地面上。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Subotica_%28Szabadka%2C_%D0%A1%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0%29_-_catholic_cathedral.JPG/960px-Subotica_%28Szabadka%2C_%D0%A1%D1%83%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0%29_-_catholic_cathedral.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1644},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cathedral_of_St._Theresa_of_Avila%2C_Subotica"},{"name":"赖赫勒家族宫殿","orig":"Palača Raichle","intro":"建筑师费伦茨·赖赫勒为自己设计的宅邸，把新艺术的花卉装饰用到极致，立面和窗框上都是彩瓷拼出的图案。它不像公共建筑那样规整，更像一份个人趣味的展示。如今内部用作展览空间，外立面本身已足够细看。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Centar_I%2C_Subotica%2C_Serbia_-_panoramio_%283%29.jpg/960px-Centar_I%2C_Subotica%2C_Serbia_-_panoramio_%283%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raichle's_Palace"}],"foods":[{"name":"帕普里卡什","orig":"PAPRIKAŠ","intro":"伏伊伏丁那常见的家常炖菜，用红椒粉调味，鸡肉或牛肉炖到酥软，酱汁浓稠，配面疙瘩或面包吃。城里不少传统餐馆午市都有，寒冷天气里点一份最踏实。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Chicken_Paprikash_%28Csirke_Paprik%C3%A1s%29.jpg/960px-Chicken_Paprikash_%28Csirke_Paprik%C3%A1s%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicken_paprikash"},{"name":"库伦","orig":"Kulen","intro":"这一带著名的风干香肠，猪肉与红椒粉、香料混合后灌肠晾制，切片后颜色深红，咸香带辣。秋冬是制作季节，市场上能看到整串挂着卖，配面包和葡萄酒都合适。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Kulin_%28serviran%29.jpg/960px-Kulin_%28serviran%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":794},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kulen"},{"name":"鱼汤","orig":"Riblja čorba","intro":"帕利奇湖一带的渔家做法，用河鱼加红椒粉慢熬，汤色红亮，味道偏辣而鲜。湖畔餐馆里常见，通常配面包吃，天凉时喝一碗很暖。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/Pot_of_Hungarian_Fisherman%27s_Soup_%28Hal%C3%A1szl%C3%A9%2C_Karpfensuppe%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fisherman's_soup"},{"name":"斯特鲁德利","orig":"Štrudla","intro":"苏博蒂察所在的巴奇卡地区，卷式面点做得普遍，苹果、樱桃或奶酪卷进薄面皮里烤，切段后撒糖粉。老派点心店和家庭餐桌上都能见到，配咖啡是常见的下午组合。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Strudel.jpg/960px-Strudel.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strudel"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Centar_I%2C_Subotica%2C_Serbia_-_panoramio_%284%29.jpg/1280px-Centar_I%2C_Subotica%2C_Serbia_-_panoramio_%284%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[21.1242078,43.4476788],[21.1260107,43.4438448],[21.1276049,43.444565],[21.1285811,43.4426595],[21.132689,43.4431393],[21.1356231,43.442412],[21.13535,43.440544],[21.137791,43.4365515],[21.1393434,43.4301294],[21.1398757,43.4251551],[21.1389085,43.4201521],[21.1396414,43.4194588],[21.1388173,43.4180837],[21.1393075,43.416791],[21.1405256,43.4166315],[21.1397489,43.4145069],[21.1406683,43.4142758],[21.1411502,43.411205],[21.1428578,43.4111486],[21.1500883,43.4169021],[21.156184,43.4179143],[21.1577848,43.417235],[21.1592348,43.4213591],[21.1556576,43.4303023],[21.1556847,43.4362487],[21.1543079,43.4419322],[21.1515799,43.4468612],[21.1468022,43.450561],[21.1474941,43.4510479],[21.1445837,43.4514486],[21.134716,43.4500823],[21.1242078,43.4476788]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"苏博蒂察","en":"Subotica","voyage":null}}}